      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Please! This would make world exploring so much better! If not this, then perhaps giving players the ability to set what the instance would be in their settings, so region and invite type would be set to whoever goes in first, then expire after 30 seconds as usual. We really need portals to inherit invite type and region unless they're dropped manually by a player.",
