      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is what I came here to submit, thanks for submitting it first.\n\nIf we don't want to deal with public people, and just hang out with a group of friends, it means we can NEVER walk into a portal because this feature does not exist.\n\nThe way portals exists is a cool way to flow around the game, which is rendered impossible by those of us who want to stick with a certain group.",
